--
--   The kernel levels contribute `(q₀ + q_B) · CB 1 · n U` with `q₀ + q_B ≤ 3 D^lamp`
--   (hypothesis (3)) and `CB 1 ≤ (Kc + 2)(G + 2)(Cc + D₀)`, `G + 2 ≤ (2 W' + 12)(zsz p + 1)`;
--   the middle level `401 · CB E · n' U ≤ 802 (Kc+2)(G+2)(Cc+D₀) D^lamp n U`; the loops
